## Backlog - elements non developpes (source: executive draft K-12)

> **📋 NOTE (2026-06-18)**: This Backlog is a **high-level roadmap**. Each item now maps to a **Spec Kit feature spec** (001–012 in `specs/` directory), which is the **single source of truth** for implementation. See `specs/INDEX.md` for complete mapping and use `/speckit.specify` → `/speckit.plan` → `/speckit.tasks` workflow for detailed planning.

### Regles de priorisation
- P0: indispensable pour un MVP operationnel
- P1: important apres MVP
- P2: optimisation / extension

### Student experience (MVP mobile-first)
- [P0] Dashboard etudiant avec "Continue where I left off", taches du jour, deadlines et carte de progression par competence.
- [P0] UX par tranche d'age (primaire vs college): ecrans simplifies, taille des cibles, objectifs adaptes.
- [P0] Boucle d'apprentissage courte: micro-lecons, videos courtes, exercices interactifs, hints pas-a-pas, retry immediat.
- [P0] Accessibilite de base: read-aloud, sous-titres, contraste, taille de texte.
- [P0] Continuite d'usage: pause/reprise cross-device et synchronisation robuste.
- [P1] Adaptivite: ajustement de difficulte, next-best-activity, mode rattrapage, activites d'approfondissement.
- [P1] Couche projet/pratique: mini-projets, evidence capture (photo/audio/video/output).
- [P1] Collaboration securisee: activites en binome/equipe, reactions/discussions moderees enseignant.
- [P2] Virtual labs navigateur (science/coding/experiments).

### Gamification (simple, pedagogique, non toxique)
- [P0] Progress bars + mastery map par matiere/competence.
- [P0] Streaks (quotidien/hebdo) + micro-celebrations contextualisees.
- [P0] Quests/missions et objectifs de classe/equipe.
- [P1] XP/levels et customisation avatar/profil.
- [P1] Achievement map et showcase des projets.
- [P1] Regles anti-patterns: leaderboards publics optionnels (desactives par defaut pour plus jeunes), pas de surenchere de badges.

### Parent portal (lightweight et actionnable)
- [P0] Dashboard parent: progression enfant, devoirs semaine, absences/travail manque, alertes, evenements.
- [P0] Communication securisee parent-enseignant + annonces + accuses de lecture.
- [P0] Consentements/approbations (sorties, activites, permissions).
- [P0] Multi-enfants: switch rapide, calendrier combine, notifications foyer.
- [P1] Digest hebdo (email/push) + "How to help this week".
- [P1] Mode traduction parent + centre de ressources famille.

### Teacher console (gain de temps + intervention)
- [P0] Gestion classe: roster/groupes, calendrier, statut eleves.
- [P0] Authoring: lecons, quiz, devoirs, rubriques, templates, tagging grade/subject/skill.
- [P0] Evaluation: auto-correction quiz + correction manuelle rubric + feedback audio/video.
- [P0] Differenciation/intervention: groupes par besoin, alertes inactifs/en difficulte, remediation.
- [P0] Analytics classe: engagement, completion, mastery gaps, at-risk alerts.
- [P1] Bibliotheque de ressources partagees et reaffectation/remediation workflow.
- [P2] IA enseignant: generation de questions et variation de niveau.

### Director / School leadership
- [P0] Dashboard ecole: usage actif, completion, resultats, attendance trends, teacher adoption.
- [P0] Governance: RBAC fin, journaux d'audit, consent/privacy records, export/inspection.
- [P0] Couverture curriculum + workflow d'approbation contenu.
- [P1] Decision support: comparaisons ecole/niveau/classe, heatmaps intervention, KPI programme.
- [P1] Change management: campagnes d'adoption, objectifs ecole, suivi formation enseignants.
- [P2] Multi-ecoles/district + rapports executifs personnalises.

### Plateforme transverse (web + mobile)
- [P0] Parite web/mobile sur les parcours coeur par role.
- [P0] Onboarding faible friction par role + empty states guides.
- [P0] Notifications role-based (in-app, email, push) + rappels intelligents.
- [P0] Privacy/safety/compliance: consentement parental, permissions role-based, moderation/reporting, audit trail.
- [P1] Interoperabilite: SCORM/xAPI, import/export LMS, integrations SIS/identity/calendar/storage.
- [P1] CMS contenu: versioning, workflow d'approbation, localisation/traduction.
- [P1] Fondation analytics: cohortes, adoption, mastery, completion.
- [P2] A/B testing framework et experimentation produit.

### Offline, bandwidth et accessibilite avancee
- [P0] Mode faible bande passante + mode video leger.
- [P1] Download lessons + sync au retour reseau.
- [P1] WCAG renforce: clavier, focus visible, navigation ecran lecteur.

### Suggested rollout
- [MVP/P0] Student dashboard + Teacher dashboard + Parent dashboard + Assignments/Quizzes + Progress tracking + Messaging + streaks/progress bars/quests + Director dashboard + consent/RBAC.
- [Phase 2/P1-P2] Adaptive pathways + Virtual labs + portfolios + IA differentiation + hierarchy multi-school + analytics avancees + multilingual riche.

### Dependances techniques et produit a planifier
- [P0] Definition of Done commune (pedagogie + produit + conformite).
- [P0] Telemetrie evenementielle standardisee pour toutes les experiences role-based.
- [P1] Gouvernance contenu (owner, SLA validation, versioning).
- [P1] Plan d'adoption (enseignants, parents, directions) et KPIs d'usage.

